      "help_en": "The media asset ID, which is the video ID. You can obtain the video ID by using the following methods:\nFor videos uploaded through the console, logon to the ApsaraVideo VOD console (https://vod.console.aliyun.com) and choose Media Files > Audio/Video to view the video ID.\nWhen you call the https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/55407.html operation to obtain the upload URL and credential, the video ID is the value of the VideoId parameter in the response.\nAfter the video is uploaded, call the https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/86044.html operation to query the video ID. The video ID is the value of the VideoId parameter in the response",
      "help_zh": "媒资ID，即视频ID。可通过以下方式获取：\n通过控制台上传的视频，可登录点播控制台 (https://vod.console.aliyun.com)，选择媒资库 > 音/视频查看视频ID。\n通过https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/55407.html接口获取上传地址和凭证时，视频ID为返回参数VideoId的值。\n视频上传后，可通过https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/86044.html接口查询视频ID，为请求后返回参数VideoId的值",
